Comment: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:03.90,Kanji B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k109}鎖{\k37}に{\k81}繋{\k57}が{\k17}れ{\k42}た{\k28}囚{\k43}わ{\k41}れ{\k50}の{\k15}身{\k48}は{\k25}
Comment: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:07.51,Kanji B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k54}時{\k29}が{\k43}過{\k41}ぎ{\k29}て{\k42}ゆ{\k38}く{\k18}だ{\k17}け{\k25}
Comment: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:16.47,Kanji B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k53}罪{\k48}と{\k87}罠{\k63}救{\k14}い{\k17}の{\k82}祈{\k10}り{\k17}は{\k81}届{\k22}か{\k352}ず{\k25}
Comment: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:42.96,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}In the cracked abyss of mercy's night,
Comment: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:47.34,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}illusions scatter, shadows torn apart
Comment: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:51.83,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A cry of warning, a violet prayer,
Comment: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:56.38,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}unfurls as roses, wild and burning
Comment: 0,0:00:56.60,0:01:00.12,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The weary pilgrim, buried in stone,
Comment: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.46,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}fades to dust beneath the ruins
Comment: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:08.88,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Still they wander, chasing light,
Comment: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:14.07,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}praying to the heavens
Comment: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:16.68,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}long desired
Comment: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:22.12,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Silence of the endless tale,
Comment: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:27.45,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}hidden resisters sing a melody of grief
Comment: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:34.47,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Jade awakens from its slumber,
Comment: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:40.51,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}chains still bind the captive body
Comment: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:44.14,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Time only passes;
Comment: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:51.17,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}footsteps creep, drawing ever nearer
Comment: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:59.93,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The sacred grail, a fountain offered,
Comment: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:04.13,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}surrenders to the moonlit praise
Comment: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:10.00,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Embrace the Greater Will, the vast command, and drink the night's
Comment: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:14.89,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}divine intent
Comment: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:45.31,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Silence of the endless tale,
Comment: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:50.81,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}hidden resisters sing a melody of grief
Comment: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:57.81,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Awakening from a jade slumber,
Comment: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:03.90,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}chains still bind its captive body
Comment: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:07.51,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Only time slips onward;
Comment: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:16.47,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}sins and snares endure, as salvation's prayer never reaches
